p.src:
The useful dimensionless number is therefore $\eta_B
\equiv
\frac{N_B-N_{\bar B}}{N_\gamma}
\sim
\frac{N_p-N_{\bar p}}{N_p+N_{\bar p}}
\sim 10^{-8},$ where the last value is the rounded order used in the course, not a precision determination. Once an odd-looking number appears, it simply began that way ceases to be a satisfying stopping point. A quantitative mechanism should explain why the answer is small and why it has a definite sign.

